From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:27:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] tests: the instruction snippet lists of m16-check.sh

The .code16gcc/.code16/.code32/.code64 encoding comparison with GNU as
reads its instructions from these files; they were left out of the
commit that added the script (tests/*.txt is ignored by default).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
